{"id": "3147495", "revid": "41997", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3147495", "title": "\u00c9ric Judor", "text": "\u00c9ric Judor () un actor francez, regizor, scenarist \u0219i comediant francez. A deveni celebru al\u0103turi de Ramzy Bedia, cu duoul comic \u00c9ric et Ramzy.\n\"\u00c9ric et Ramzy\" a ap\u0103rut \u00een special in serialul \"H\" ( 1998-2002), care i-a f\u0103cut deosebit de cunoscu\u021bi al\u0103turi de Jamel Debbouze.\nDup\u0103 mai multe lungmetraje al\u0103turi de prietenul s\u0103u Ramzy, a \u00eenceput o carier\u0103 ca actor solo.\nA creat, scris \u0219i produs serialul \"Platane\" (2011 - 2019) pentru Canal +, dar este \u0219i cap de afi\u0219 al comediilor \"Mohamed Dubois\" (2013), \"Problemos\" (2017) \u0219i \"Roulez jeunesse\" (2018).\n\u00cen 2023, a ap\u0103rut \u00een serialul Netflix \"Singurul candidat\".\nLeg\u0103turi externe.\n "}
